  "body": "Some homeserver requests (such as `/account/3pid/email/requestToken`) are proxied to the IS.\r\n\r\nWe are in the process of upgrading ISes to support [MSC2140](https://github.com/matrix-org/matrix-doc/pull/2140), which defines an IS v2 API with authentication.\r\n\r\nHomeservers that proxy to the IS will need to add support for this new API version and auth scheme. It is anticipated that the IS v1 API will be deprecated and removed soon after v2 goes live.",
